 "comments": 6, "score_up": 22, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "\"Black folks, especially black women, deliver this historic Democratic majority. And it's time Democrats deliver for black America. Reparations now.\u201d", "large_image": "BEyCs1ROFnB52RVG.png", "title": "Dem Rep Pressley demands 'reparations now' as part of 120th Congressional agenda"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToiM14U6", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 41, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8944382, "raw_content": "U.S. drug overdose deaths continue to decline sharply, with provisional data through June 2026 showing an estimated 65,724 overdose deaths over the preceding 12-month period.\n\n\nKey Statistics for 2026\n\n\u2022 Overall Trend: Drug overdose deaths have dropped for 18 consecutive months, representing an 11.3% decrease compared to the previous 12-month period and a 41.5% decrease from the peak of 112,418 deaths recorded during the Biden administration.\n\u2022 Synthetic Opioids (Fentanyl): Overdose deaths involving synthetic opioids declined by 18.7%.\n\u2022 Heroin & Other Opioids: Heroin overdose deaths fell by 34.8%, and natural/semi-synthetic prescription opioid deaths dropped by 5.4%.\n\u2022 Stimulants: Psychostimulants (including methamphetamine) decreased by 14.1%, and cocaine-related deaths dropped by 6.3%", "author": "laredditarmy", "created": 1794962971369, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Deplora", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "This Is Major News & No Major News Outlet Has Mentioned It...", "last_comment_created": 1794964469127, "content": "<p>U.S. drug overdose deaths continue to decline sharply, with provisional data through June 2026 showing an estimated 65,724 overdose deaths over the preceding 12-month period.</p>\n<p>Key Statistics for 2026</p>\n<p>\u2022 Overall Trend: Drug overdose deaths have dropped for 18 consecutive months, representing an 11.3% decrease compared to the previous 12-month period and a 41.5% decrease from the peak of 112,418 deaths recorded during the Biden administration.\n\u2022 Synthetic Opioids (Fentanyl): Overdose deaths involving synthetic opioids declined by 18.7%.\n\u2022 Heroin &amp; Other Opioids: Heroin overdose deaths fell by 34.8%, and natural/semi-synthetic prescription opioid deaths dropped by 5.4%.\n\u2022 Stimulants: Psychostimulants (including methamphetamine) decreased by 14.1%, and cocaine-related deaths dropped by 6.3%</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 41, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2122413729153216552", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiM0WFs", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 74, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8944168, "raw_content": "", "author": "journalist", "created": 1794951365851, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "TheAftermath", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/eagleleak1/status/2122413729153216552?a=7z5ryM7GQDPKC3rhKYc&s=46", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": 